  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><h2>• About our brand and products:</h2><p>ProudOfChrist is a Christian brand created by Christians and for Christians.<br>We design practical and inspiring products that help believers live their faith every day.<br>Our catalog includes Bible study guides, Christian handbags, lifestyle accessories, and faith-centered items created to encourage, strengthen, and inspire.</p><hr><h2>• What makes us different:</h2><p>We truly care about our community. We do not see customers as numbers. Our mission is to serve, uplift, and support Christians around the world.<br>Our designs are created with purpose, our messages are sincere, and our products are made to carry real meaning in everyday life.<br>We are also committed to giving back. ProudOfChrist occasionally donates to orphanages or other charitable projects because we believe that faith must be expressed through action, compassion, and generosity.</p><hr><h2>• How affiliates can earn:</h2><p>Affiliates earn a generous commission on every approved sale generated through their unique link or code.<br>Benefits include:</p><ul><li><p>Competitive and scalable commissions</p></li><li><p>Long cookie duration for higher conversions</p></li><li><p>Early access to new product launches, promotions, and exclusive deals</p></li></ul><hr><h2>• How to promote us:</h2><p>Here are effective ways affiliates promote ProudOfChrist:</p><ul><li><p>Share faith-based content on TikTok, Instagram, Facebook, or YouTube</p></li><li><p>Present our Bible study guides, Christian handbags, or accessories in lifestyle or devotional content</p></li><li><p>Create videos or posts about Christian living, Bible study routines, gift ideas for believers, and more</p></li><li><p>Promote seasonal campaigns such as Christmas, Easter, birthdays, baptisms</p></li><li><p>Use the marketing assets available in your affiliate dashboard</p></li></ul><hr><h2>• Other information:</h2><p>We welcome influencers, Christian content creators, devotional pages, blogs, and anyone who wants to share their faith with intention.<br>We are open to long-term and personalized collaborations.<br>Our team provides fast support, extra content when needed, and guidance to help you increase conversions.</p><hr><p><br></p></div></div>",
